    "summary": "This PR adds image resolution-metadata support: a new class method FastImage.resolution(uri), instance methods #resolution/#resolution_units, and format-specific parsers for JPEG (JFIF APP0 + EXIF), PNG (pHYs), BMP (DIB XPelsPerMeter/YPelsPerMeter) and TIFF (EXIF rational tags). The EXIF reader was reworked to a two-pass approach (collect RATIONAL offsets, then read them), and tests extend GoodFixtures with a resolution column plus a full sweep test. Reviewers should focus on the nil-result memoization in FastImage#resolution, the EOF behavior of the new JPEG scan loop, and the forward-only rational-offset handling in the EXIF parser.",
